# Local Preview Server

- This repo is a static site. Use `python3 scripts/serve_local.py` from the repo root to preview it locally.
- The helper binds to `127.0.0.1`, chooses an available port starting at `58926`, disables browser caching for CSS/JS, and prints the URL.
- Prefer this helper over raw `python3 -m http.server` so future sessions do not pile up stale servers or fixed-port conflicts.
- If a server from this helper is already running, the next run reuses it and prints its URL. Use `python3 scripts/serve_local.py --restart` only when a fresh process is needed.
